#
# The Maxwell (SM53) instruction encodings the shader translator decodes. tools/decodetree makes decode-sm53.inc from
# this file (src/nx/CMakeLists.txt, cmake/decodetree.cmake), and decode.c defines a trans_ function for each pattern.
# The opcode is the top 16 bits of the 64-bit instruction, which decode.c gives the decoder (-w 16), the left bit
# bit 63. 0 and 1 are fixed, - is either. Spaces are for reading.
#
# A pattern's name is the opcode's, O_<NAME> in the translator, whose list (SM53_OPS in translator.h) gives the enum
# order and the display names. CCTLT is a further encoding of CCTL. Patterns that both match a word are in a { }
# group, the narrower first: decodetree refuses any other overlap.
# Eden's opcodes the translator has no name for (IDP, IMADSP, VABSDIFF4, LONGJMP, PLONGJMP, RAM, RTT, SAM,
# GETLMEMBASE, SETLMEMBASE) are left out and decode as unknown. Fork additions to the set this file started from
# (DSET, ATOM.CAS, OUT immediate, SUATOM, CCTLT, STP, TLD.B, TLD4.B, TMML.B, TXD.B, VABSDIFF, VSET, VSHL, VSHR)
# match Eden's encodings.

